The '''V-21.1 Chevlex light haulcraft''',<ref name="Star Wars Encyclopedia: The Comprehensive Guide to the Star Wars Galaxy">''[[Star Wars Encyclopedia: The Comprehensive Guide to the Star Wars Galaxy]]''</ref> more commonly known as the '''Fondor Haulcraft''' after its manufacturer, was a class of [[starship]] used for transport manufactured by [[Fondor Yards Commercial Ventures]] used during the [[Imperial Era]].<ref name="Dawn of Rebellion" /> [[Luthen Rael]] used [[Luthen Rael's Fondor Haulcraft|a modified version]] of the haulcraft that was also equipped with a [[Fondor Droid Mod]].<ref name="Dawn of Rebellion" />

